    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9495" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cōmoedus</span></b> , a, um,
		adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωμὡδός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to comedy</i>, <i>comic</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">natio,</span>”
